# Requirement triage

For **new/unclear** multi-repo requirements or unlabeled hub issues (intake):

1. Delegate to subagent `requirement-triage` (see `.cursor/TEAM.md`)
2. Load skill `.agents/skills/requirement-triage/SKILL.md`
3. Do not expand root `AGENTS.md` with triage procedures

After labels/`ready-for-agent`, hand **plan + progress** to `product-lead`.
Implementation → `engineer-in-<role>` (parallel when disjoint).

Labels: `bug`|`enhancement` + `needs-triage`|`needs-info`|`ready-for-agent`|`ready-for-human`|`wontfix`.
